10 REM GFXDEMO: THE GRAPHICS STATEMENTS ON SCREEN 2, 320 BY 240 IN 16 COLORS.
20 REM THE PICTURE OF UXCBASIC\SAMPLES\GFXDEMO.UXB. A KEY ENDS IT, AND IT THEN
30 REM PRINTS THE COLOR POINT READ FROM THE LARGEST RING, 10.
40 SCREEN 2
50 REM THE 16 COLORS, A SWATCH OF 20 BY 20 EACH
60 FOR C=0 TO 15: RECT C*20,0,C*20+19,19,C: NEXT
70 REM A DOTTED RULE UNDER THE SWATCHES
80 FOR X=0 TO 318 STEP 2: PSET X,20,15: NEXT
90 FRAME 0,22,319,239,15
100 CHAR 8,26,"6502DOS GRAPHICS",1
110 REM A FAN OF LINES FROM THE BOTTOM MIDDLE
120 FOR X=1 TO 318 STEP 9: LINE 160,238,X,40,11: NEXT
130 REM TEN RINGS OVER THE FAN, RADIUS 10 IN COLOR 1 TO RADIUS 100 IN COLOR 10
140 FOR R=10 TO 100 STEP 10: CIRCLE 160,135,R,R/10: NEXT
150 P=POINT(260,135)
160 GET K$: IF K$="" THEN 160
170 SCREEN 0
180 PRINT "POINT(260, 135) IS";P
